<%- include('partials/head') %>

<section class="pi-hero">
  <h1>What is your way out?</h1>
  <p class="lead" style="margin-left:0">A plumber and a podcaster do not leave their jobs the same way, so NoBossly does not give them the same quest board. Pick your path and everything downstream changes with it &mdash; the quests you get and the rungs you climb.</p>
  <p class="muted">Each climbs its own ten rungs, named for the work: a plumber goes Odd Jobber to Signwritten to Own Boss, a creator goes Lurker to Sponsored to Institution. Same ten stages underneath, same XP, same rule that no rung is bought with points.</p>
</section>

<div class="paths-grid">
  <% paths.forEach(function (p) { %>
    <a class="path-tile" href="/paths/<%= p.slug %>">
      <span class="pt-emoji"><%= p.emoji %></span>
      <strong><%= p.label %></strong>
      <span class="muted small"><%= p.blurb %></span>
      <span class="pt-go">See this path →</span>
    </a>
  <% }) %>
</div>

<section class="cta-band" style="margin-top:1.6rem">
  <h2>Not sure which one?</h2>
  <p class="muted">Take the &ldquo;still figuring it out&rdquo; path. Wanting out is enough to start &mdash; you'll land in a quest board built for exactly that, and can switch to a specific path any time once you know more.</p>
  <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" style="margin-top:1.1rem;display:inline-block" href="/signup?path=exploring">Start there →</a>
</section>

<style>
  .pi-hero { max-width: 44rem; padding: clamp(1.2rem, 4vw, 2.5rem) 0 1.4rem; }
  .pi-hero h1 { font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 5vw, 3rem); letter-spacing: -.02em; text-wrap: balance; }
  .paths-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(16rem, 1fr)); gap: .9rem; }
  .path-tile {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .3rem;
    background: var(--panel-2); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 1.1rem 1.2rem; text-decoration: none; color: var(--text);
  }
  .path-tile:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }
  .pt-emoji { font-size: 1.7rem; line-height: 1; }
  .path-tile strong { font-size: 1.08rem; }
  .pt-go { margin-top: auto; padding-top: .5rem; color: var(--accent); font-size: .88rem; font-weight: 600; }
</style>
<%- include('partials/foot') %>
